      "page_id": "Samsung_Portable_SSD_X5_User_Manual_v0_0_English_00015",
      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "Software can be uninstalled via “Uninstall or change a program”. Go to Control panel → Programs → Programs and Features → Uninstall or change a program → Double-click “Samsung Portable SSD Software” and select “Yes”\nSoftware need to be deleted manually by executing PSSD_Cleanup.bat in application installation path. (Normally c:\\ProgramData\\Samsung Apps\\Portable SSD\\PSSD_Cleanup.bat) Please refer to FAQ in the Samsung website (http://www.samsung.com/samsungssd) for more details.",
