      "page_id": "Samsung_Portable_SSD_X5_User_Manual_v0_0_English_00007",
      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "(For Password protection and Firmware update)\n* If you format partition of the X5 after purchase, Samsung Portable SSD Software stored in the drive will be deleted. In such case, please download the “Samsung Portable SSD” application from Samsung website (http://www.samsung.com/portable-ssd)\n* Installation of Samsung Portable SSD Software for X5 will automatically remove previous version, if remaining in your computer.",
